        "matched_product": "extra virgin olive oil",
        "snippet": "Experience TRULY® EVOO by Corto – pure, fresh olives oil. Ideal for bread-dipping, salad dressings, cheese boards. Enhance your dishes now. Enjoy a one-hour group tasting with a certified olive oil expert. ... Free Shipping in Contiguous US! ... Named TRULY® because it’s the real deal — full-bodied and dynamic with bright floral notes you could only get from fresh-squeezed juice. Made from California-grown olives harvested at their peak freshness, our ultra fresh, Extra Virgin Olive Oil is cold-extracted and packaged upon order so it tastes just as fresh when it reaches your kitchen. As oil is dispensed in our FlavorLock™ Boxes, the bag inside collapses, keeping air out (and all the goodness in). ... “This is the only TRULY Extra Virgin Olive Oil that reminds me of what my Nonna e Mamma used growing up in our home. The flavor it enriches our food with is second to none. For bread-dipping and alongside your cheese board for extra zip. Perfect for finishing on warm entrees. ... It’s not easy to get a fresh olive off the tree, but we harvest our olives at peak freshness in the Fall just as they turn green with a hint of violet. If we waited until they were black, it would be easier to harvest, but our oil wouldn’t taste nearly as delicious. Our unique FlavorLock™ Box is the only packaging that keeps your olive oil fresh from the time it is filled until the very last drop. Think of it as a mini cellar - it successfully protects the oil from light, heat and air, keeping it 100% truly-fresh.",
